# November 21, 2026: Steuben County, New York: Hammondsport and the Keuka Lake wine cellars, Bath, Corning and
# Painted Post, Hornell, Canisteo, Cameron Mills and Addison. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region wny,
# which offered Hammondsport); the Atlas had no place at all within 25 km of Hammondsport, nor in Corning or Hornell.
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py, including the Steuben County Register list),
# HMdb marker pages, the Western New York Wine Company's Register form (NPGallery, 14000585), the Governor's press
# release of July 2026 on the Pleasant Valley winery, pleasantvalleywine.com, The Clio, Crooked Lake Review (1996),
# heritagevillagesfl.org (the Corning-Painted Post Historical Society), rockwellmuseum.org, the City of Hornell's
# railroad museum page, the Steuben County Historical Society's blog, the National Cemetery Administration's Bath page,
# the Village of Addison's church list, the New York State Military Museum's armory page and stayblacksheepinn.com.
# Every other Register form tried (91000236, 05000169, 10000030, 99000196, 91000235) is an NPGallery placeholder.
